<title>PAKISTAN: ICI Pakistan net falls 7.97 pct.</title>
<headline>ICI Pakistan net falls 7.97 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees) vs year ended December 31, 1995</p>
<p>    Sales		   6,935 vs 5,990</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  814 vs   888</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	542 vs   589</p>
<p>    Interim div	17.5 pct vs 50 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Final Dividend	  nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is ICI Pakistan Ltd, a subsidiary of Imperial Chemical Industries Plc. It manufactures polyester, soda ash, paint and pharmaceuticals. Book closure April 8-17. AGM on April 17. (-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192))</p>
</text>
